OL,3,GNEWSASchools closed and homes without
OL,4,Awater in Baildon
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo schools have been closed and a
OL,7,Fnumber of properties in Baildon are
OL,8,Fwithout water due to a fault in the
OL,9,Fnetwork, according to Yorkshire Water.
OL,11,FThe firm said an area around Temple
OL,12,FRhydding Drive was experiencing "no
OL,13,Fwater or low water pressure" and it
OL,14,Fwould take an estimated four to six
OL,15,Fhours to fix.
OL,17,FHoyle Court School and Baildon C of E
OL,18,FPrimary School have both confirmed they
OL,19,Fwill be closed for the rest of the day
OL,20,Fas a result of the problem.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
