OL,3,GNEWSASchools closed and homes without
OL,4,Awater in Baildon
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Yorkshire Water spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"We're aware that a number of
OL,8,Fproperties in Baildon are currently
OL,9,Fwithout water supply and we apologise
OL,10,Ffor the inconvenience."
